      "content": "gnomes? lol that's a weird way to put it. but i get what you mean about the chaos. \n\nso if those \"rogue elements\" or \"gnomes\" are constantly trying to mess things up, how does the cell actually keep control? like, is there some kind of defense system or a way that the \"foreman\" keeps everything from just falling apart and turning into total mayhem? i'm curious how the cell prevents that kind of interference from winning out.",
